; Skipper Flipper: 10 minute run-around test for the WEEDO Tina 2 (tina2-skr-pico.cfg).
; NOT sliced, no extrusion, heaters stay off. Moves inside a 10 x 10 mm box (X 40-50, Y 47-57)
; at Z 10, the middle of the Tina 2's safe area (X 5-85, Y 0-105).
; Ender 3 stock speeds: 50 mm/s print moves (F3000), 150 mm/s travel (F9000, which the Tina 2's
; max_velocity: 97 caps at 97 mm/s), 500 mm/s^2 acceleration (Marlin's Ender 3 default).
; 180 loops of: square at 50 mm/s, square at travel speed, a bow tie of diagonals at travel speed.
; Estimated time: 10.0 minutes (trapezoids with 5 mm/s corners).
; Upload on the Printer page (or to the SD card) and press Print. STOP is in the left bar.
